# /changelog

When the user says **`/changelog`**, **update the changelog**, or **refresh CHANGELOG**:

1. Read and follow **`.cursor/skills/changelog/SKILL.md`** (project skill `changelog`).
2. Default: update **`[Unreleased]`** on `origin/main`; do not cut a release unless asked.
3. Commit only `CHANGELOG.md` with message `docs: update CHANGELOG` when the user wants a commit.

Do not dump raw `git log` into the file. Cluster by feature; use Added / Changed / Fixed / Security / Removed.
